  "Description": {
    "Cost": 7073751,
    "UIName": "Doloire",
    "Id": "chassisdef_doloire_DLR-OD",
    "Name": "Doloire",
    "Details": "Designed for the Republic Armed Forces in 3121, the Doloire is an 80 ton Omnimech designed with a mixture of Clantech and Inner Sphere tech. Designed around a 320-rated Clan XL Engine and an Endo-Composite Structure, the Doloire has 32 tons of pod space, with a pair of Clan ER Medium Lasers hardwired into the Mechs CT. The Doloire DLR-OD is armed with a trio of Streak SRM-4’s and a pair of additional ER Medium lasers all of which are Clan spec. A pair of TSEMP’s round out the design.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
